  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The AI Hub for Sustainable Development, co-designed by UNDP and the Italian G7 Presidency, is a strategic initiative within the Italy-Africa Mattei Plan focusing on nine priority African countries. This Initiation Plan aims to co-design the Hub as a multistakeholder platform to strengthen local AI ecosystems and accelerate responsible AI innovation in Africa.</narrative>
